CHAPTER.VERS:
And the priest shall see : and, behold, the swelling
white in the skin, and it hath turned the hair white, and living raw flesh in the swelling;
quick…: Heb. the quickening of living flesh

But if the scall shall spread 
        much in the skin 
        after his cleansing;

The garment also that the plague of leprosy is in,  a woollen 
        garment, or a linen 
        garment;
